bc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implemented in local commit 1ae781b63ab (shared with dissocial-unpleasant-adouri and newborn-advanced-hoopoe; one change because the loop only scores once all three land, and the files are disjoint).\n\n- `eval_solver.py`: `_run_pass_finder_case` (PASS_FINDER / PASS_CONTAINER: resolve the case's `criterion`, run `_run_criterion_case`) and `_run_isf_case` (`passes.pass1_isf` over inline `plan`/`log`), dispatched by exact id before the criterion arm. Missing/unknown `criterion` or missing `log` raises ValueError.\n- Offline evidence: new tests in `tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py` pass; 8 of them fail against origin/main 05c6414358f code. `run_eval` over each of the 3 specs with a FakeRunner-backed solve reports coverage 1.0.\n- No live run: the defect was dispatch (`no eval solver`), fully exercised offline with FakeRunner through the production pass functions.\n- Portability: pure in-process dispatch; no subprocess, fd, signal or path handling added.\n- `test_provider_parity.py`: docstring corrected only; ISF still has no parity arm.","timestamp":1794971663993613515},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Landed: Gerrit change 3421, merged as 07f023db8031f1a09b5d0e51ea1ca3ff35cd63c2 (patch set 2 = local commit 8cc90245e08, LLM-Review +1 by rebar-review-bot, Verified +1 by rebar-ci-bot). `make verify` on that exact tree exited 0: lint + typecheck + import-convention guard passed, default tier 21390 passed / 30 skipped, integration tier 226 passed / 2 skipped (log: worktree .rebar/scratch/3d705fec-verify/make-verify-3.log, run 2026-11-17 PST).\n\nThe landing commit carries all three sibling bugs (shared with dissocial-unpleasant-adouri and newborn-advanced-hoopoe), so file_impact now also lists the sibling files, each marked \"shared landing commit only\".\n\nAC evidence: `tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py::test_run_eval_scores_every_case_of_the_pass_named_specs` (3 params, coverage == 1.0), `test_pass_finder_case_without_a_criterion_raises`, `test_isf_case_without_a_log_raises`, existing `test_unknown_prompt_raises` unchanged and passing.","timestamp":1794984736231239042}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1794264431405575001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"19b2c1b9-191b-49c0-98e1-285f0ae19d4b","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"81a1-0fc3-496d-4a00"},{"link_uuid":"df127f9a-8675-4d8a-9224-e8c6c9ef2940","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"246e-71dd-911a-4742"},{"link_uuid":"7301391c-b27b-4768-ab4f-83e395ce1a2c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4dfb-1cb3-229c-4742"},{"link_uuid":"e627682e-1f92-457a-8d21-2e5165a2a93b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8cf0-cb18-d8ff-44df"}],"description":"## Problem\n\nThe live prompt-eval loop in `.github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml` (`eval-live`) calls `rebar.llm.evals.eval.run_eval` on every dataset-bearing spec under `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/`. Three of those specs have no solver, so every case is recorded as a run error and the spec reports coverage 0.00:\n\n| spec | cases (at `REBAR_EVAL_MAX_CASES=12`, 3 epochs) | message |\n|---|---|---|\n| plan-review-container | 36 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-container'` |\n| plan-review-finder | 36 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-finder'` |\n| plan-review-isf-finder | 12 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-isf-finder'` |\n\nThe error is raised at the end of `run_case` (`src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py:423`) after no prompt-id branch matches.\n\n## Root cause (measured 2026-11-17, origin/main 05c6414358f)\n\n`run_case` resolves a plan-review spec to a solver only through `_criterion_id(prompt_id)` (`eval_solver.py:76`), which strips `plan-review-` and looks the remainder up in the criterion registry. These three specs are named after the PASS prompts, not a criterion (`passes.PASS_FINDER`, `PASS_CONTAINER`, `PASS_ISF` at `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/passes.py:140,150,151`), so `finder`, `container` and `isf-finder` resolve to nothing. The data is runnable:\n\n- `plan-review-finder` (37 cases) and `plan-review-container` (12 cases) carry a per-case `criterion` field; every value resolves in `registry.by_id` (checked: 0 unresolved), and every container case (G3/G4) carries the `children` payload `_run_criterion_case` needs (`eval_solver.py:101`).\n- `plan-review-isf-finder` (4 cases) carries inline `log` and `plan` text, which is exactly the input of `passes.pass1_isf(runner, cfg, *, plan, session_log_text)` (`passes.py:417`), a single non-agentic structured call.\n\n## Approach\n\nAdd the missing dispatch to `run_case`, reusing the production pass functions so the eval scores the same code path the gate runs:\n\n1. Pass-finder arm: when `prompt_id` is `passes.PASS_FINDER` or `passes.PASS_CONTAINER`, read the case's `criterion`, resolve it with `_criterion_id`, and run `_run_criterion_case` for it (which already routes container criteria to `pass1_container` and the rest to `pass1_chunk`). A case without a resolvable `criterion` raises `ValueError` naming the case id, so it is a visible run error, never a silent pass.\n2. ISF arm: when `prompt_id` is `passes.PASS_ISF`, a new `_run_isf_case` calls `passes.pass1_isf` with the case's `plan` and `log` under `resolve_gate_config(repo_root)` and returns `{\"findings\": [...]}`. A case missing `plan` or `log` raises `ValueError`.\n3. Both arms sit with the other exact-id arms (novelty/verifier), before the criterion arm.\n\n`INLINE_UNADMISSIBLE_CRITERIA` is unchanged: an `input`-only ISF fixture (sidecar replay) still cannot run, because it has no log. No config key, env var or flag is added.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py` — the two arms, `_run_isf_case`, docstrings.\n- `tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py` — offline tests with `FakeRunner`.\n- `tests/unit/test_provider_parity.py` — correct the docstring of `test_the_isf_finder_spec_is_excluded_because_it_resolves_to_no_arm` (`:404`), which states `run_case` has no arm for the spec; its assertions (no PARITY arm) stay unchanged.\n\nPortability: no subprocess, file descriptor, signal or path handling is added; the arms are pure in-process dispatch.\n\n## Testing\n\nOffline with `FakeRunner` (no model):\n- happy path: a finder case (`criterion: T2`) and a container case (`criterion: G3`, `children`) from the packaged specs run and return a `findings` list; an ISF case with `plan`/`log` returns the canned finding attributed `criteria == [\"ISF\"]`;\n- failure path: a finder case with no `criterion`, and an ISF case with no `log`, raise `ValueError`.\n- end to end: `run_eval` over each of the three specs with a solve that delegates to `run_case` with a `FakeRunner` reports `coverage == 1.0`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `run_case` resolves `plan-review-finder`, `plan-review-container` and `plan-review-isf-finder` cases to a solver; checked by `tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py`, where `run_eval` over each packaged spec with a `FakeRunner`-backed solve reports `coverage == 1.0`.\n- [x] A finder/container case without a resolvable `criterion`, and an ISF case without `log`, raise `ValueError` naming the problem; checked by unit tests.\n- [x] Genuinely unknown prompt ids still raise \"no eval solver\" (existing `test_unknown_prompt_raises` passes).\n- [x] `make verify` exits 0.\n","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py","reason":"pass-finder and ISF solver arms"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py","reason":"offline tests for the new arms"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_provider_parity.py","reason":"correct a docstring that says run_case has no ISF arm"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/evals/eval.py","reason":"shared landing commit 07f023db803 only: changed by sibling bug dissocial-unpleasant-adouri"},{"path":".github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml","reason":"shared landing commit only: sibling bug dissocial-unpleasant-adouri"},{"path":"docs/workflow-engine.md","reason":"shared landing commit only: sibling bug dissocial-unpleasant-adouri"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_eval.py","reason":"shared landing commit only: sibling bugs dissocial-unpleasant-adouri and newborn-advanced-hoopoe"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_scorers.py","reason":"shared landing commit only: sibling bug newborn-advanced-hoopoe"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py","reason":"shared landing commit only: sibling bug newborn-advanced-hoopoe"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","246e-71dd-911a-4742"],["relates_to","4dfb-1cb3-229c-4742"],["relates_to","8cf0-cb18-d8ff-44df"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"a2e38327-81c2-4356-bc28-405a96020eed","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3952-3e5b-96bd-4ce0","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live prompt-eval loop has no solver for plan-review-container, -finder and -isf-finder specs (coverage 0.00)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0bfd3e95-8962-4c80-8134-1a9f36b33f8d","b41b17a8-ab43-4f0b-8d6d-1f06fde3ccf1","df127f9a-8675-4d8a-9224-e8c6c9ef2940","f0576d41-0688-421e-978f-3c1b9af54af8","a3d632b4-9f33-404c-b9cf-766956ed66d1","1a79004a-5031-48ca-a4d1-c45ad17d3fc9","fdbafa60-ae45-48c1-bec4-dd51055bb791","7301391c-b27b-4768-ab4f-83e395ce1a2c","e627682e-1f92-457a-8d21-2e5165a2a93b","355b48f2-2b2f-4cab-95d6-1e1f68bdab34","4a178ef5-bb1c-4875-a31e-fd1567a32690","9bf6aac5-c4af-4e55-8576-7a9368dd9c58","08cd4736-07e9-47c0-840c-1bc543240fba","84700739-745e-449a-abde-50f183a553c4","a2e38327-81c2-4356-bc28-405a96020eed","a0d0e79b-1eb5-40f8-a8a4-eb090c3a78fb"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794985551529906769,"uuid":"6cefd5b3-387a-467d-a3ed-ecebddc06858"}